  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Northern Corridor Infrastructure Masterplan Update, Analytical comparative cost study and Projects Investment Prospectus for two priority projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives of the assignment are threefold:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1. Assess the current status of the infrastructure facilities in the Northern corridor, assess including the capacity and gaps and set goals for future upgrading to improve performance, in line with the aspiration of the Northern Strategic Plan 2020-2026 and the African Union&#xbf;s Program Infrastructure Development for Africa (PIDA) Priority Action Plan and national transport master plans (NTMPs)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2. Assess the transport costs in the corridor, including logistics costs and set indicators for continuous cost measurement&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3. Identify and prioritise possible areas of investments to improve corridor performance&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
